<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">MAKE A LITTLE PLAN</view
  ><view class="title"><view>把下一次相遇，</view><view>排进日历。</view></view
  ><block wx:if="{{success}}"
    ><view class="notice"
      >询单已收到。Hannah
      会联系你确认方案、档期和定金；当前尚未锁定拍摄时间。</view
    ><view class="token" selectable>{{token}}</view
    ><button class="button" bindtap="copy">复制私人查询码</button
    ><button class="chip space" bindtap="requests">查看我的询单</button
    ><text class="small-link" bindtap="again">计划另一次拍摄</text
    ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view></block
  ><block wx:else
    ><view class="section-number">01 / 你的拍摄</view
    ><view class="label">拍摄类型</view
    ><picker
      range="{{sessions}}"
      range-key="name"
      value="{{sessionIndex}}"
      bindchange="chooseSession"
      ><view class="picker">{{sessions[sessionIndex].name}} ↓</view></picker
    ><view class="label">套餐</view
    ><picker
      range="{{packageLabels}}"
      value="{{packageIndex}}"
      bindchange="choosePackage"
      ><view class="picker">{{packageLabels[packageIndex]}} ↓</view></picker
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="price">{{selectedPackage.from?'起价 ':''}}A${{price}}</view
      ><view class="muted" wx:for="{{selectedPackage.zhDetails}}" wx:key="*this"
        >{{item}}</view
      ><view class="row space"
        ><text>加拍真实胶片 + A$100</text
        ><switch checked="{{film}}" bindchange="film" color="#3b4832" /></view
      ><view class="muted"
        >一卷含冲洗。路费、加片与其他选项另议；以 Hannah 确认的报价为准。</view
      ></view
    ><view class="label">喜欢的风格</view
    ><picker
      range="{{styleNames}}"
      value="{{styleIndex}}"
      bindchange="chooseStyle"
      ><view class="picker">{{styleNames[styleIndex]}} ↓</view></picker
    ><view class="section-number">02 / 选日期</view
    ><view class="heading">把时间留给喜欢的事。</view>
    <view class="calendar-card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><button
          class="month-arrow"
          bindtap="previousMonth"
          disabled="{{month===minMonth}}"
          aria-label="上个月"
        >
          ‹</button
        ><picker
          mode="date"
          fields="month"
          value="{{month}}"
          start="{{minMonth}}"
          end="{{maxMonth}}"
          bindchange="month"
          ><view class="calendar-month">{{month}} ↓</view></picker
        ><button
          class="month-arrow"
          bindtap="nextMonth"
          disabled="{{month===maxMonth}}"
          aria-label="下个月"
        >
          ›
        </button></view
      >
      <view class="calendar-grid"
        ><view class="weekday" wx:for="{{weekdays}}" wx:key="*this"
          >{{item}}</view
        ><view class="day-wrap" wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="key"
          ><button
            wx:if="{{!item.blank}}"
            class="calendar-day {{selectedDay===item.key?'chosen':''}} {{item.today?'today':''}}"
            disabled="{{loading||item.disabled}}"
            data-day="{{item.key}}"
            bindtap="selectDay"
            aria-label="{{item.key+'，'+(item.available?'有公开时段':'暂无公开时段')}}"
          >
            {{item.day}}<view
              class="day-dot"
              wx:if="{{item.available}}"
            /></button></view></view
      ><view class="calendar-legend"
        >● 有公开时段 · 灰色日期可填写偏好咨询</view
      ></view
    >
    <view class="muted space"
      >Brisbane 时间（AEST，UTC+10），比北京时间快两小时。询单不锁定档期。</view
    >
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在查看档期…</view
    ><view wx:elif="{{calendarError}}" class="notice error"
      >{{calendarError}}<button class="chip" bindtap="loadDates">
        重试
      </button></view
    ><view wx:elif="{{!slots.length}}" class="notice"
      >本月暂无公开时段，不一定代表约满。请在下方填写你希望的日期。</view
    >
    <block wx:else
      ><view class="label">{{selectedDay}} · 选择时段</view
      ><button
        class="time-option {{slotId===item.id?'active':''}}"
        wx:for="{{daySlots}}"
        wx:key="id"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="selectSlot"
      >
        {{item.label}} {{slotId===item.id?'✓':'＋'}}
      </button></block
    >
    <view wx:if="{{slotId}}" class="notice"
      >已选：{{slotLabel}}<text class="small-link" bindtap="clearSlot"
        >取消所选时段</text
      ></view
    >
    <view class="label">偏好的日期 / 灵活程度</view
    ><input
      value="{{preferredDates}}"
      data-field="preferredDates"
      bindinput="field"
      maxlength="500"
      placeholder="例如周末下午，或具体日期"
    /><view class="section-number">03 / 联系与想法</view
    ><view class="label">姓名 *</view
    ><input
      value="{{name}}"
      data-field="name"
      bindinput="field"
      maxlength="100"
    /><view class="label">微信号 *</view
    ><input
      value="{{wechat}}"
      data-field="wechat"
      bindinput="field"
      maxlength="100"
    /><view class="label">邮箱（选填）</view
    ><input
      value="{{email}}"
      data-field="email"
      bindinput="field"
      maxlength="254"
    /><view class="label">地点（选填）</view
    ><input
      value="{{location}}"
      data-field="location"
      bindinput="field"
      maxlength="250"
    /><view class="row space"
      ><view class="label">喜欢的参考作品 · {{references.length}}/6</view
      ><text class="small-link" bindtap="editReferences">去选片</text></view
    ><view class="reference-strip"
      ><view class="reference-thumb" wx:for="{{references}}" wx:key="id"
        ><image src="{{item.src}}" mode="aspectFill" /><button
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="removeReference"
          aria-label="移除参考照片"
        >
          ×
        </button></view
      ></view
    ><view wx:if="{{!references.length}}" class="muted"
      >可在「选风格」收藏照片，Hannah 会随询单收到你的参考。</view
    ><view class="label">想法 / 妆造 / 场景需求</view
    ><textarea
      value="{{message}}"
      data-field="message"
      bindinput="field"
      maxlength="2500"
      placeholder="一起告诉我，就不用重复沟通啦。"
    /><checkbox-group bindchange="consent" class="space"
      ><label
        ><checkbox
          value="yes"
          checked="{{consent}}"
          color="#3b4832"
        />我同意工作室使用这些信息回复询单、管理预约，并在此设备保存草稿及私人查询码。</label
      ></checkbox-group
    ><view class="row"
      ><text class="small-link" bindtap="guide">拍摄须知</text
      ><text class="small-link" bindtap="privacy">询单隐私说明</text></view
    ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view
    ><button
      class="button"
      bindtap="submit"
      disabled="{{sending}}"
      loading="{{sending}}"
    >
      {{sending?'正在提交…':'发送我的拍摄计划 ↗'}}</button
    ><view class="muted space"
      >小程序不收取付款。Hannah 确认方案及定金后才会保留档期。</view
    ></block
  ></view
>
